{"4000140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crop Empire", "steam_appid": 4000140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your realm, harvest your wealth!</strong><br><i>Crop Empire</i> is a relaxing and rewarding agricultural idle-strategy game. Plant seeds, nurture crops, upgrade tools, and expand your farming dominion through smart resource management and strategic upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plant &amp; Harvest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/942bc66b1a0f53150d04605f14ab9a12.poster.avif?t=1758892382\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/942bc66b1a0f53150d04605f14ab9a12.webm?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/942bc66b1a0f53150d04605f14ab9a12.mp4?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with humble plots. Sow a variety of crops, water them, and watch them grow—then harvest to earn money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Farm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/3ec627965b7f7c8e13ceddc62f9ce3d1.poster.avif?t=1758892382\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/3ec627965b7f7c8e13ceddc62f9ce3d1.webm?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/3ec627965b7f7c8e13ceddc62f9ce3d1.mp4?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use currency to unlock new fields and upgrade your land—each expansion boosts yield and opens the door to more profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Tools &amp; Automate!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/b2eb6366a184e440397e348ff4cea986.poster.avif?t=1758892382\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/b2eb6366a184e440397e348ff4cea986.webm?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/b2eb6366a184e440397e348ff4cea986.mp4?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to farm faster—or build helper drones that tend your crops, so you can reap benefits even while away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Growth Tree!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/81f13a7cd39d572ef3b7d1d4587ba83c.poster.avif?t=1758892382\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/81f13a7cd39d572ef3b7d1d4587ba83c.webm?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/81f13a7cd39d572ef3b7d1d4587ba83c.mp4?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest harvested resources into a branching upgrade tree (Skill Grove). Boost productivity, unlock new specials, optimize automation, and tailor growth to your playstyle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasonal Events &amp; Talents!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in seasonal events for bonus rewards. Unlock unique talent boosts that enhance your farm’s efficiency—at the cost of increased maintenance or timing challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle Management System!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/e241bf0896d6fbe98db368cc30bb6914.poster.avif?t=1758892382\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/e241bf0896d6fbe98db368cc30bb6914.webm?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000140/extras/e241bf0896d6fbe98db368cc30bb6914.mp4?t=1758892382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your farm to operate on its own. Watch as automated systems plant, tend, and harvest—return to see your empire flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you complete it all, achieve it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you grow your farm, make sure to do all the challenges and gain all the rewards from achievements to progress even further into the godly farmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your realm, harvest your wealth!</strong><br><i>Crop Empire</i> is a relaxing and rewarding agricultural idle-strategy game. Plant seeds, nurture crops, upgrade tools, and expand your farming dominion through smart resource management and strategic upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plant &amp; Harvest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item